From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Vincent Leon <leon@mbp.com>
Date: Mon, 16 Nov 2026 17:27:11 +0800
Subject: [PATCH 15/15] feat(providers): let a custom provider carry its own
 icon

Custom providers that extend the same agent all showed that agent's icon,
so two Codex gateways and the native Codex looked identical in the
pickers. A provider override can now set icon to an inline SVG, which
clients already draw for plugin providers, tinted through currentColor.
The daemon rejects icons that script, handle events or reference
anything outside the SVG, since the icon reaches every connected client.
